[00:27.44]Kind and patient, perfect in love,
[00:33.16]Was Christ, who came down from above.
[00:39.86]He took care of our needs
[00:43.53]With words and by deeds;
[00:48.06]He gave of his time and his love.
[00:55.78]He would keep the lowly in mind
[01:02.16]By healing the sick, deaf, and blind.
[01:09.05]To his royal commission he proved true
[01:17.52]And willingly said: “I want to.”
[01:25.38]We now try to follow his way
[01:51.08]In all of our dealings each day.
[01:57.68]We are loving and kind
[02:01.16]To all whom we find;
[02:05.56]We help them to learn and obey.
[02:13.63]We respond to friends when in need;
[02:20.35]We love them in word and in deed.
[02:27.15]So if widows and orphans should ask you,
[02:34.91]Then readily say: “I want to.”
